le=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> value </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> abs</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">rnorm</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">30</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> mean</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">100</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> sd</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">50</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> category </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;B&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></div><div style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:#000\">d3 </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> rbind</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">d1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> d2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></div><div style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span></div><div style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:#000\">facet_plot</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">p1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> panel </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;Stacked Barplot&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> data </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> d3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> geom </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> geom_bar</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> mapping </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> aes</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">x </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> value</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> fill </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">as</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">factor</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">category</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> stat</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;identity&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span></div><div style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span></div><div style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:#800\"># Barplot I would like to add:</span></div><div style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:#800\"># ggplot(d3, aes(x = id, y = value, fill = as.factor(category))) + geom_bar(stat = &#39;identity&#39;)</span></div></div></code></div>The output seems wrong as a normal ggplot barplot gives a different result.<br><br></div></div>"
